215v_686e6977-acd0-40df-916b-b47f4e16a39g)<br>![Image](img_v3_0215v_52dde99d-b679-466f-9441-7e303df4596g)<br>![Image](img_v3_0215v_91324156-26bc-4bac-a81f-cdd99df3323g)<br><br>产品实物 👇<br>![Image](img_v3_0215v_ae02755a-1a17-464d-8708-06074f3abfag)<br><br><br>4. 现在有点太粉嫩了，有一些颜色用回豆沙粉吧？<br>![Image](img_v3_0215v_1eb223f4-e06f-4796-8e4d-6c0bdb6dc98g)<br>![Image](img_v3_0215v_85b5e977-2409-44e5-a3f8-0f71f8d32f4g) |  | 价值评分: 12 | 飞书群「设计审核」· 2026-09-28 19:55 · 吴礼芳 |  |  | ["图片"] | 吴礼芳 |  |
